abstract: >-
  beal-conjecture v27 port of foundations v0.27-mcom-four-props-inhabited
  at 51bba93. Honest slice Level26/HonestB0Search/ includes packaged
  Tate/Mazur/Ribet/Kolyvagin displays. Algebraic Tate algorithm / Néron,
  Frey 13-isogeny, abstract Ribet, and Nonempty(Fintype(E(Q))) stay
  def Prop. Vendor unchanged db7a556/fea0c393. Concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.22379293.
